The source, dependency, build-flag and evidence fingerprints match. All 15 retained run-log hashes and the fixture executable hash also match, and the prebuilt onboarding and secret-confinement tests passed independently.

The review still has required fixes for cancellation and authority retirement. Verification can also report Gateway Pass despite a failed IAM prerequisite read, or Red Team Pass despite a failed statistics read. The live receipt and native proof of Keychain cleanup remain missing.
